<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>For once, at the very end, shut up and do as you're told!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just show your face now and then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having people come from outside is a joy, you know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> keep Arata safe from Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
